# Build context for the immutable production API image (build context is ./api).
# Everything api/main.py imports at runtime must stay included: main.py,
# client.py, platform_prune.py, suspected_bug.py, timezone_utils.py,
# __init__.py, requirements.txt, artifacts/ and eco_driving_explorer/.
#
# Patterns are matched against the whole context-relative path, so nested
# directories need the `**/` prefix. `__pycache__` alone would only drop the
# top-level one and would still bake artifacts/__pycache__ and
# eco_driving_explorer/__pycache__ into the image.

# Python bytecode and caches. The checkout carries a stale root-owned
# __pycache__/main.cpython-312.pyc written by the previous container-root
# runtime; it must never enter the image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class

# Test, type and lint caches
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov

# Virtualenvs
**/.venv
**/venv

# Secrets are supplied through the environment, never baked into the image
**/.env
**/.env.*

# VCS, editor, agent and OS noise
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.claude
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/.DS_Store

# Logs and scratch
**/*.log
**/tmp
